Z||000000||varnster||11-29-2000||09:43 PM||||Just had the wonderful pleasure of changing <BR>out the 87 gt oil pan gasket,That will stop that leak WRONG. 30 MIN LATER ,DRIP, DRIP!!!!<BR>I cant find the leak its driping off the flywheel shroud, where can this be coming from?? its oil,its brown,and its not coming from the oil pan. the starter had to be cleaned the oil was caked on it,HELP!! ||||reg||8
